        "retrieved": "2026-10-12",
        "revision": 1378612690,
        "heading": "Horticulture",
        "text": "This species of melaleuca is often grown in parks and as a street tree in tropical and sub-tropical areas like Brisbane and as far south as Sydney. It prefers a sunny location but will tolerate poor, waterlogged soils. It has also been used as a street tree in Hong Kong.",
